      "finalizer": "Copy exactly selected existing final_model/model.json, train_metrics.json, README.md, run.py byte-for-byte to deliverable and list all four relative_paths in StructuredOutput. Original base is valid if selected by score; do not force candidate promotion or fake optimizer steps. No retraining, rescoring, reconstructing source, downloading model weights or paper writing."
